- Kim, E. H.-W., Lee, C., & Do, Y. K. (2019). *The effect of adult children’s working hours on visits to elderly parents: A natural experiment in Korea*. Population Research and Policy Review, 38, 53–72. 정책 도입 일정은 표 1, 1단계와 IV-FE 결과는 표 4–5. [원문](https://doi.org/10.1007/s11113-018-9486-0)
