- Na, C., Lee, D., Hwang, J., & Lee, C. (2021). *Strategic groups emerged by selecting R&D collaboration partners and firms’ efficiency*. Asian Journal of Technology Innovation, 29(1), 109–133. 그림 1과 표 1·3. [원문](https://doi.org/10.1080/19761597.2020.1788957)
- 이창준. ML101, *Unsupervised Learning*. USArrests 데이터, 표준화, WSS·실루엣, K=4 군집 결과. [수업 페이지](https://changjunlee.com/teaching/ml101/weekly/posts/10_week) · [한국어 사전 강의](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ocauaL0BgnU)
